{
  "Configure the browser subagent. It requires": "配置浏览器子智能体。它需要安装 ",
  "Google Chrome": "Google Chrome",
  "to be installed. The browser subagent can be invoked by typing /browser in the conversation input box.": "。您可以在对话框中输入 /browser 来调用浏览器子智能体。",
  "Choose a predefined security preset for the agent. This controls terminal auto-execution policy, and file access policy.": "为智能体选择预设的安全级别。这将控制终端的自动执行策略以及文件访问策略。",
  "Learn more about": "了解更多关于",
  "Manually customize individual settings.": "手动自定义各项设置。",
  "Default": "默认",
  "Requires manual review for all terminal commands and file accesses outside of the working folders.": "对所有终端命令以及工作文件夹外的文件访问进行人工审查。",
  "Useful for typical development with an emphasis on security. It prioritizes safety over speed by requiring manual approval for all terminal commands and files outside the project directory.": "适用于注重安全性的典型开发场景。它通过要求对所有终端命令以及项目目录之外的文件进行人工批准来优先保证安全性，而非追求执行速度。",
  "Full machine": "完全机器访问",
  "All terminal commands require review. The agent can read or write to any file in the machine.": "所有终端命令均需审查。智能体可以读取或写入机器上的任何文件。",
  "Useful for tasks that require file access across your full machine. The agent has full read and write access to all local files, but all proposed terminal commands require manual review and approval before running.": "适用于需要跨整台机器访问文件的任务。智能体对所有本地文件具有完全的读写权限，但所有提出的终端命令在运行前都需要进行人工审查和批准。",
  "Unrestricted": "无限制",
  "Disables all safety barriers for maximal iteration velocity.": "禁用所有安全限制以获得最大的迭代速度。",
  "A high-risk mode that disables all safety barriers. The agent operates with full system access, auto-executes all terminal commands, and reads or writes to all local files without review prompts.": "一种禁用所有安全屏障的高风险模式。智能体运行于完全系统访问权限下，自动执行所有终端命令，并读取或写入所有本地文件，而无需任何审查提示。",
