  "Agent always asks for review.": "智能体总是请求审查。",
  "Agent asks for permission before executing commands matched by a deny list entry.": "智能体在执行匹配拒绝列表条目的命令前会请求许可。",
  "Agent auto-executes commands matched by an allow list entry.": "智能体自动执行允许列表中的命令。",
  "Agent never asks for review. This maximizes the autonomy of the Agent, but also has the highest risk of the Agent operating over unsafe or injected Artifact content.": "智能体绝不请求审查。这可以最大化智能体的自主权，但同时智能体在不安全的或被注入的工件 (Artifact) 内容上运行的风险也最高。",
  "Allow Agent to view and edit files outside of the current workspace automatically. Use with caution: this provides the Agent access to additional potentially-relevant information, but also allows the Agent to access credential files, secrets, and other files outside of the workspace that could be targeted in prompt injection attacks or other exploits by malicious actors.": "允许智能体自动查看和编辑当前工作区之外的文件。请谨慎使用：这为智能体提供了获取其他潜在相关信息的能力，但也允许其访问凭据文件、机密信息以及工作区之外的其他文件，这些文件可能会成为恶意行为者进行提示注入攻击或其他漏洞利用的目标。",
  "Allow Tab to view and edit the files in .gitignore. Use with caution if your .gitignore lists files containing credentials, secrets, or other sensitive information.": "允许 Tab 补全功能查看和编辑 .gitignore 中的文件。如果您的 .gitignore 中列出了包含凭据、机密或其他敏感信息的文件，请谨慎使用。",
  "Allow/deny agent command execution outside the sandbox.": "允许/拒绝智能体在沙箱外执行命令。",
  "Allow/deny agent read access to specific URLs or domains.": "允许/拒绝智能体对特定 URL 或域名的读取访问权限。",
  "Allow/deny agent read access to specific files or directories.": "允许/拒绝智能体对特定文件或目录的读取访问权限。",
  "Allow/deny agent write access to specific files or directories.": "允许/拒绝智能体对特定文件或目录的写入访问权限。",
  "Allow/deny specific terminal commands.": "允许/拒绝特定的终端命令。",
  "Allows the agent to access files outside of your current workspace.": "允许智能体访问当前工作区之外的文件。",
  "Ask a quick question without interrupting the main conversation.": "快速提问，不中断主对话。",
  "Checks for pending changes before merging.": "在合并前检查未完成的更改。",
  "Clone current workspace into a new independent workspace": "将当前工作区克隆为一个新的独立工作区",
  "Commands the agent can run outside the sandbox.": "智能体可在沙箱外运行的命令。",
  "Configure agent hooks": "配置智能体挂钩 (Hooks)",
  "Configure default behaviors, skills, and MCP servers.": "配置默认行为、技能和 MCP 服务器。",
  "Configure settings for Best of N mode.": "配置 Best of N 模式的设置。",
  "Controls whether the agent can run custom JavaScript to automate complex browser actions.": "控制智能体是否可以运行自定义 JavaScript 来自动执行复杂的浏览器操作。",
  "Custom path for the browser user profile directory. Leave empty for default (~/.gemini/antigravity-browser-profile).": "浏览器用户配置文件目录的自定义路径。留空则使用默认路径 (~/.gemini/antigravity-browser-profile)。",
  "Determines the markup language of the output.": "确定输出的标记语言。",
  "GCP Project ID for enterprise features.": "企业级功能的 GCP 项目 ID。",
  "Highlight newly inserted text after accepting a Tab completion.": "接受 Tab 补全后高亮显示新插入的文本。",
  "Hook will only trigger if the tool name matches run_command or view_file.": "仅当工具名称匹配 run_command 或 view_file 时，挂钩才会触发。",
  "Hook will only trigger if the tool name matches run_command.": "仅当工具名称匹配 run_command 时，挂钩才会触发。",
  "Hook will only trigger if the tool name starts with browser_.": "仅当工具名称以 browser_ 开头时，挂钩才会触发。",
  "Hook will trigger if any tool is executed.": "如果执行了任何工具，挂钩都将触发。",
  "If non-zero, all user-specified sizes, e.g. in \\rule{500em}{500em}, will be capped to maxSize ems. Otherwise, elements and spaces can be arbitrarily large": "如果非零，所有用户指定的大小（例如在 \\rule{500em}{500em} 中）都将限制在 maxSize em 内。否则，元素和空间可以任意大",
  "Limit the number of macro expansions to the specified number, to prevent e.g. infinite macro loops. If set to Infinity, the macro expander will try to fully expand as in LaTeX.": "限制宏展开的次数为指定数量，以防止无限宏循环等。如果设置为 Infinity，宏展开器将尝试像 LaTeX 中那样完全展开。",
  "Makes \\color behave like LaTeX's 2-argument \\textcolor, instead of LaTeX's one-argument \\color mode change.": "使 \\color 的行为类似于 LaTeX 的双参数 \\textcolor，而不是 LaTeX 的单参数 \\color 模式更改。",
