  "Paths the agent can read.": "智能体可以读取的路径。",
  "Port number for Chrome DevTools Protocol remote debugging. Leave empty for default (9222).": "Chrome DevTools Protocol 远程调试的端口号。留空则使用默认值 (9222)。",
  "Predict the location of your next edit and navigates you there with a tab keypress.": "预测您下次编辑的位置，并使用 Tab 键将您导航至该处。",
  "Quickly add and update imports with a tab keypress.": "通过按 Tab 键快速添加和更新导入。",
  "Render display math flush left.": "将显示数学公式靠左对齐。",
  "Render display math in leqno style (left-justified tags).": "以 leqno 样式（左对齐标签）渲染显示数学公式。",
  "Render math in display mode, which puts the math in display style (so \\int and \\sum are large, for example), and centers the math on the page on its own line.": "在显示模式下渲染数学公式，这会使公式呈显示样式（例如，\\int 和 \\sum 变大），并在页面上另起一行居中显示。",
  "Run in a new worktree": "在新的工作树 (Worktree) 中运行",
  "Run in your current workspace": "在您的当前工作区中运行",
  "Set the speed of tab suggestions": "设置 Tab 补全建议的速度",
  "Show suggestions when typing in the editor": "在编辑器中输入时显示建议",
  "Team of subagents to do long running work": "用于执行长期运行任务的子智能体团队",
  "Terminal commands the agent can execute.": "智能体可以执行的终端命令。",
  "Toggle if a confirmation is shown when using the \"Reload Window\" button.": "切换在使用“重新加载窗口”按钮时是否显示确认提示。",
  "Trust the input, enabling all HTML features such as \\url.": "信任输入，启用所有 HTML 功能（如 \\url）。",
  "Turn on strict / LaTeX faithfulness mode, which throws an error if the input uses features that are not supported by LaTeX.": "启用严格/LaTeX 忠实度模式，如果输入使用了 LaTeX 不支持的功能，将抛出错误。",
  "URLs the agent can actuate on using the browser.": "智能体可以使用浏览器操作的 URL。",
  "URLs the agent can read or open in the browser.": "智能体在浏览器中可以读取或打开的 URL。",
  "When enabled, \"Explain and Fix\" actions will continue in the current conversation instead of starting a new one.": "启用后，“解释并修复”操作将在当前对话中继续，而不是启动新对话。",
  "When enabled, 'Explain and Fix' actions will continue in the current conversation instead of starting a new one.": "启用后，“解释并修复”操作将在当前对话中继续，而不是启动新对话。",
  "When enabled, Agent can interact with Google Workspace through the API to search and read documents.": "启用后，智能体可以通过 API 与 Google Workspace 进行交互，以搜索和读取文档。",
  "When enabled, Agent can use browser tools to open URLs, read web pages, and interact with browser content. This allows the Agent access to important (and often critical) knowledge and methods of validation, but any browser integration does increase exposure to external malicious parties for security exploits.": "启用后，智能体可以使用浏览器工具打开 URL、阅读网页并与浏览器内容进行交互。这使得智能体能够获得重要（且通常是关键）的知识和验证方法，但任何浏览器集成确实会增加恶意外部人员进行安全漏洞利用的风险。",
  "When enabled, Agent is given awareness of lint errors created by its edits and may fix them without explicit user prompting.": "启用后，智能体将感知其编辑产生的 Linter 错误，并在无需用户明确提示的情况下自动修复。",
  "When enabled, Agent will use IDE's shell integration to detect and report terminal command execution.": "启用后，智能体将使用 IDE 的 Shell 集成来检测并报告终端命令的执行情况。",
  "When enabled, Agent will use IDE's shell integration to detect and report terminal command execution. When disabled, the agent will use its own shell. Restart the application for this to take effect.": "启用后，智能体将使用 IDE 的 Shell 集成来检测并报告终端命令的执行。禁用时，智能体将使用其自身的 Shell。重启应用程序以使该设置生效。",
  "When enabled, Antigravity will play a sound when Agent finishes generating a response.": "启用后，当智能体完成响应生成时，Antigravity 将播放提示音。",
  "When enabled, enforces settings that prevent the agent from autonomously running targeted exploits and requires human review for all agent actions. Visit antigravity.google/docs/strict-mode for details.": "启用后，将强制执行相关设置以防止智能体自主运行有针对性的漏洞利用，并要求对智能体的所有操作进行人工审查。访问 antigravity.google/docs/strict-mode 了解详情。",
  "When enabled, sandboxed commands are allowed to make network requests.": "启用后，沙箱命令将被允许进行 network 请求。",
  "When enabled, terminal commands run with sandbox restrictions.": "启用后，终端命令将在沙箱限制下运行。",
  "When enabled, the Changes Overview toolbar will automatically expand when Agent finishes generating a response.": "启用后，“更改概览”工具栏将在智能体完成响应生成时自动展开。",
  "When enabled, the agent will be able to access its knowledge base to inform its responses and automatically generate knowledge items in the background.": "启用后，智能体将能够访问其知识库以辅助其响应，并在后台自动生成知识项。",
  "When enabled, the agent will be able to access its knowledge base to inform its responses and automatically generate knowledge items in the background. Disabling this will prevent the agent from accessing existing knowledge items, but will not delete them.": "启用后，智能体将能够访问其知识库以辅助响应生成，并自动在后台生成知识项。禁用此功能将阻止智能体访问已有的知识项，但不会删除它们。",
  "When enabled, the agent will be able to access past conversations to inform its responses.": "启用后，智能体将能够访问过去的对话来作为响应生成的参考。",
  "When enabled, your UI will be slightly modified to ensure more consistent demos. This is only recommended for demo purposes. In most cases, you can run \"Antigravity: Start Demo Mode\" and \"Antigravity: Stop Demo Mode\" to control this switch and update your ~/.gemini/antigravity data directory.": "启用后，您的 UI 将会有轻微修改，以确保演示效果的一致性。这仅推荐在演示目的下使用。在大多数情况下，您可以运行“Antigravity: 开始演示模式”和“Antigravity: 停止演示模式”来控制此开关并更新您的 ~/.gemini/antigravity 数据目录。",
  "When running commands, the agent will try to use this address, and fall back to to the \"connector.host.featureDefault\" host if not defined.  Note: hosts set here with auto-run enabled will have internet access restricted soon.": "在运行命令时，智能体将尝试使用此地址，如果未定义，将回退到“connector.host.featureDefault”主机。注意：此处设置了启用自动运行的主机，其互联网访问权限很快将受到限制。",
  "Would you like to grant the agent access to google drive?": "您是否要授予智能体对 Google 云端硬盘 (Google Drive) 的访问权限？",
  "The app will be accessible from the menu bar and will keep running in the background when all windows are closed.": "应用程序可从菜单栏访问，并在关闭所有窗口时继续在后台运行。",
  "Prevent the computer from sleeping while the app is running.": "在应用运行期间防止计算机进入睡眠状态。",
  "Keyboard shortcuts for quick navigation and control.": "用于快速导航和控制的键盘快捷键。",
