  "URLs the agent can read or open in this workspace.": "智能体在此工作区中可以读取或打开的 URL。",
  "Restricts agent tools to a secure, isolated local sandbox.": "将智能体工具限制在安全、隔离的本地沙箱中。",
  "Gives the agent permission to create and upload documents to google drive": "允许智能体创建文档并将其上传到 Google 云端硬盘 (Google Drive)",
  "Gives the agent permission to search through google drive. The agent will only see file titles, not file contents": "允许智能体在 Google 云端硬盘 (Google Drive) 中进行搜索。智能体只能看到文件标题，无法看到文件内容",
  "If enabled, you can manage your conversations from the Antigravity website. Please reload the application to apply this setting.": "启用后，您可以在 Antigravity 网站上管理您的对话。请重新加载应用程序以应用此设置。",
  "Manage Google Drive access permissions.": "管理 Google 云端硬盘 (Google Drive) 访问权限。",
